'''Papaluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] event. [[True Form]] introduced in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]] increases HP, extends Curse duration and is immune to [[Surge Attack|Surges]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

